# CI Automation Branch .gitignore

# This branch is minimal by design - it should only contain:
# - .github/workflows/ (automation workflows)
# - README.md
# - .gitignore

# Ignore everything that might accidentally get added
*

# But allow our specific files
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/sync-upstream.yml
!/.github/workflows/mirror-to-deployment-target.yml
